  "details": "I am in 6pt (Feet + Hip) FBT.\nWhen one of my controllers loses power or is powered off:\nActual:\nThe avatar drops back into 3PT.\n- The feet are no longer tracked\n- The hip is no longer tracked\n- TrackingType has a value of 3\n- The avatar's feet are grounded with automatic footsteps\nExpected:\n- The arm of the hand that lost power should flail down\n- The feet should continue to track\n- The hip should continue to track\n- TrackingType value should be 6 (according to the patch notes, because the two feet are still being tracked)\n- The feet should not be grounded",
